# Release signing for the GizeCat Android app (android/README.md, "Signing").
# Copy this file to android/keystore.properties (gitignored) and fill in YOUR OWN values.
# Without android/keystore.properties, release APK and AAB builds are unsigned; a copied file with
# empty values stops the build with an error instead.
#
# - storeFile: absolute path to your upload keystore, kept OUTSIDE the repository. Use forward
#   slashes (java.util.Properties treats a backslash as an escape), e.g. C:/Users/<you>/.keys/upload.jks
# - PKCS12 keystores (keytool's default) use one password: keyPassword = storePassword.
# - Never commit this file, the keystore or the passwords. Back up the keystore and passwords offline.
storeFile=
storePassword=
keyAlias=
keyPassword=
